      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mound_Station%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Legally, the village remains Mound Station, yet locals use Timewell exclusively today.",
